    "This review covers six selected internal CRM integration tables. It is separate from the TiDB Cloud API-record review and makes no company, customer or Hong Kong attribution.",
    "Counts remain separate by source. Native record IDs, principal identifiers and distinct full-record versions are different units; counts across sources must not be added as unique credentials or principals.",
